      "updated": 1795254055942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reads the owed flags, who follows each\nmatch, the fans of each team, and every\nuser's alert switches, in one batch\n\nRecipient: follows the match, or has\neither team as a favorite, and has\nthat kind of alert switched on\n\nWrites one pending row per person\nand event, and clears the flags in\nthe same batch",
      "originalText": "Reads the owed flags, who follows each\nmatch, the fans of each team, and every\nuser's alert switches, in one batch\n\nRecipient: follows the match, or has\neither team as a favorite, and has\nthat kind of alert switched on\n\nWrites one pending row per person\nand event, and clears the flags in\nthe same batch",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
