      "updated": 1795254055942,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Takes pending and failed rows with\nfewer than 3 attempts\n\nChecks again, now: still a recipient,\nswitch still on, has a device (ADR 0008)\n\nBuilds the text: 'GOAL! Scorer',\nscore and minute\nSends up to 100 messages per request\nMarks each row from Expo's tickets",
      "originalText": "Takes pending and failed rows with\nfewer than 3 attempts\n\nChecks again, now: still a recipient,\nswitch still on, has a device (ADR 0008)\n\nBuilds the text: 'GOAL! Scorer',\nscore and minute\nSends up to 100 messages per request\nMarks each row from Expo's tickets",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
